          <h1>How to Migrate from RSA Archer to Vanta: A Complete Guide (2026)</h1>
        </header>

        <nav class="toc" aria-label="Table of contents">
          <h2>In this guide</h2>
          <ol>
            <li><a href="#why-different">Why Archer migrations are different</a></li>
            <li><a href="#right-fit">Is Vanta the right Archer replacement for you?</a></li>
